###Block: Copies and other lines
Summon Giants.COPY=Summon Giants (Frost Giants Only)

###Block: Descriptions
Algid Enhancement.MOD	DESC:Cold creatures gain +1 Deflection bonus to AC, +1d8 HP, +1 to hit and +2 bonus against fire. See text for further.
Artic Haze.MOD	DESC:Fog obscures vision and inflicts damage.
Aura of Cold (Greater).MOD	DESC:Deals 2d6 cold damage.
Aura of Cold (Lesser).MOD	DESC:Deals 1d6 cold damage to those within 5 ft..
Binding Snow.MOD	DESC:Cast on snow it impedes movement to half.
Blizzard.MOD	DESC:Creates a blinding, freezing blizzard. All movement, sight becomes impossible. Takes 1d6 damage each round of nonlethal if unprotected.
Blood Snow.MOD	DESC:Cast on snow it drains 1d2 Con pts.
Bone Chill.MOD	DESC:Holds corporeal undead.
Boreal Wind.MOD	DESC:Creates an artic wind that deals (min(CASTERLEVEL,15))d4, see text.
Brumal Stiffening.MOD	DESC:Decrease weapon's hardness by 5 making it more brittle.
Call Avalanche.MOD	DESC:Cast outside deals 8d6 crushing damage and can bury Large or smaller creatures.
Column of Ice.MOD	DESC:Ice columns lift targets [can include yourself] if there is a ceiling you can smash for 4d6 damage.
Cometstrike.MOD	DESC:Cast outdoors deals 3d6 bludgeoning and (min(CASTERLEVEL,10))d4 cold damage and stunned for 1 round; each round another three comets strike.
Conjure Ice Beast I.MOD	DESC:Creates a creature to fight for you.
Conjure Ice Beast II.MOD	DESC:Creates a creature to fight for you.
Conjure Ice Beast III.MOD	DESC:Creates a creature to fight for you.
Conjure Ice Beast IV.MOD	DESC:Creates a creature to fight for you.
Conjure Ice Beast V.MOD	DESC:Creates a creature to fight for you.
Conjure Ice Beast VI.MOD	DESC:Creates a creature to fight for you.
Conjure Ice Beast VII.MOD	DESC:Creates a creature to fight for you.
Conjure Ice Beast VIII.MOD	DESC:Creates a creature to fight for you.
Conjure Ice Beast IX.MOD	DESC:Creates a creature to fight for you.
Conjure Ice Object.MOD	DESC:Creates any object from transparent ice.
Control Snow and Ice.MOD	DESC:May raise or lower snow &amp; ice.
Control Temperature.MOD	DESC:Reduce or raise the temperature by (min(CASTERLEVEL+1)/5) band.
Crack Ice.MOD	DESC:Shatters ice.
Crunchy Snow.MOD	DESC:Cast on snow imposes -20 penalty to Move Silently checks.
Death Hail.MOD	DESC:Successful save or take 1d2 Str &amp; Con damage.
Defile Snow and Ice.MOD	DESC:+4 profane bonus against turning attempts.
Detect Fire.MOD	DESC:Functions like detect magic but detect fire/heat within 60 ft.
Dispel Cold.MOD	DESC:As dispel evil, but affects cold creatures; +4 bonus against attacks.
Dispel Fire.MOD	DESC:As dispel evil, but affects fire creatures; +4 bonus against attacks.
Ease of Breath.MOD	DESC:Grants +20 bonus on Fortitude saves to resist altitude sickness &amp; fatigue.
Entomb.MOD	DESC:Encases and suffocates target; Fort save shakes of the ice but all take 6d6 cold damage. Failed save take 2d12 damage and 1 Con damage and suffocate.
Evergreen.MOD	DESC:Plants and Plant creatures heal 1d8+(min(CASTERLEVEL,10)), immunity to cold for the duration.
Fimbulwinter.MOD	DESC:Change to winter or strengthen winter conditions; see text.
Flash-Freeze.MOD	DESC:All earth, stone and water is drained of heat.
Flesh to Ice.MOD	DESC:Subject and all gear turns into a mindless inert ice sculpture.
Fortify Cold Creatures.MOD	DESC:Cold subtype creature gain +1 sacred bonus to all attack rolls and saving throws against fire effects.
Freeze Armor.MOD	DESC:Freezes metal armor, immobolizing and damaging the wearer. Target suffers -6 to hit, -8 to Dex and can't move; see text.
Freezing Glance.MOD	DESC:Freeze creature with your stare. Frozen creatures remain so for (CASTERLEVEL) minutes.
Frost Weapon.MOD	DESC:Deals an additional 1d6 cold damage.
Frostbite.MOD	DESC:Deals 6d6 cold damage and 2d6 Dex.
Frostburn.MOD	DESC:Deal 3d12+(min(CASTERLEVEL,20)) damage or heal likewise on cold subtype.
Frostburn (Lesser).MOD	DESC:Deal 1d12+(min(CASTERLEVEL,5)) damage or heal likewise on cold subtype.
Frostburn (Mass).MOD	DESC:Deal 3d12+(min(CASTERLEVEL,20)) damage or heal likewise on cold subtype.
Frostfell.MOD	DESC:Drops temp; see text.
Frostfell slide.MOD	DESC:Can teleport instantly from one area of slush, snow or ice to any similiar location; see text.
Gelid Blood.MOD	DESC:Cause -4 penalty to attacks, AC and all Str &amp; Dex related checks; see text.
Glacial Globe of Invulnerability.MOD	DESC:All fire descriptor spells of 3rd level or lower fail.
Glacial Ward (Great).MOD	DESC:Gain Spell Resistance 25 against all fire spells and spell-like abilities.
Glacial Ward.MOD	DESC:Grants Spell Resistance 18 against all fire spells and spell-like abilities.
Glacier.MOD	DESC:See text for details.
Glaze Lock.MOD	DESC:Increase Open Lock DC by 10.
Heartfreeze.MOD	DESC:Target becomes exhausted and dies in 1d3+2 rounds.
Heat Leech.MOD	DESC:Target must save or take 1d8 cold damage.
Hibernal Healing.MOD	DESC:Cure (min(CASTERLEVEL,15)*10) damage by absorbing all snow and slush within 10 ft.
Hibernate.MOD	DESC:Places target in suspended animation.
Ice Assassin.MOD	DESC:Create a clone of the target that will hunt and kill the original; see text.
Ice Castle.MOD	DESC:Creates an impressive castle with fortifications and magical defenses.
Ice Darts.MOD	DESC:Fire one dart per 2 levels beyond third. Ranged touch attack deals 2d4 damage half is cold.
Ice Rift.MOD	DESC:Shockwave on the ice; see text.
Ice Shape.MOD	DESC:Form an existing piece of ice into any shape that suits your purpose.
Ice Shield.MOD	DESC:Target gains Damage Reduction 15/- and prevents a total of (min(CASTERLEVEL,15)*10) damage.
Ice Ship.MOD	DESC:Creates a ship made of ice; see text.
Ice Skate.MOD	DESC:Increase base land speed by 60 feet across any icy surface, either level or inclined.
Ice Slick.MOD	DESC:Reduce movement to half and require save or creature falls.
Ice to Flesh.MOD	DESC:Restores a frozen creature to its normal state.
Ice Web.MOD	DESC:Creatures caught in effect are entangled. Any movement through effect causes 1d6 damage per round.
Iceberg.MOD	DESC:Within 20 ft. deals 20d6 crush damage (no save); 20 to 40 ft. deals 20d6 damage (save for half); 40 to 60 ft. deals 10d6 damage and not buried.
Icicle.MOD	DESC:Icicles falls when creature walks underneath dealing 4d6 dmage.
Ivory Flesh.MOD	DESC:+5 Hide check in heavy snow or ice areas.
Leomund's Tiny Igloo.MOD	DESC:Creates a warm shelter for 1 Large, 3 Medium or 12 small creatures.
Meld into Ice.MOD	DESC:Meld into a large enough block of ice.
Mindfrost.MOD	DESC:Deals 5d6 cold damage and 1d4 Intelligence damage.
Move Snow and Ice.MOD	DESC:Takes 10 minutes per 150-foot square of snow.
Numbing Sphere.MOD	DESC:Sphere moves 30 feet/round in the direction you indicate dealing 1d6 cold damage and 1d4 Dex damage.
Obscuring Snow.MOD	DESC:Obscures all vision, except yours, including darkvision to 5 ft, miss chance of 20%%.
Pass through Ice.MOD	DESC:Pass through ice 15 feet/round and can rise/sink 5 ft/round.
Raise Ice Forest.MOD	DESC:Ice trees spring up in frostfell regions within the spells range.
Shivering Touch.MOD	DESC:Melee touch attack causes it to become numb and deals 3d6 Dex damage.
Shivering Touch (Lesser).MOD	DESC:Melee touch attack causes target to shiver uncontrollably and take 1d6 Dex damage.
Snow Walk.MOD	DESC:Walk on top of snow avoiding movement penalties.
Snow Wave.MOD	DESC:Wave of snow knocks creatures in its path prone and deals 4d6 crushing plus 1d6 cold damage.
Snowdrift.MOD	DESC:Form existing snow into any shape that suits your purpose.
Snowsight.MOD	DESC:See normal even in whiteout conditions.
Snowsong.MOD	DESC:Allies gain +4 insight bonus to AC, deal 1d6 additional cold damage, fast healing 1 and resistance to cold 15.
Suppress Flame.MOD	DESC:Imbue area with negative energy and cold energy reducing illumination by half, fire spells reduced by 1 pt per die.
Thaw.MOD	DESC:Changes category of frozen items (snow, slush, etc.) by one higher; Ice and snow > slush > everfrost > fog.
Thin Air.MOD	DESC:Thins oxygen, save or suffer altitude sickness.
Wall of Coldfire.MOD	DESC:One side of wall deals 2d4 cold within 10 ft and 1d4 to those between 10 to 20 ft; See text.
Waves of Cold.MOD	DESC:Cold subtype creatures are shaken and lose its cold immunity for the duration of spell.
Whiteout.MOD	DESC:See text.
Zone of Glacial Cold.MOD	DESC:Zone deals 1d6 cold damage each round.
